# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder) and fill in your FootyStats API key.
# `.env` is ignored by git: the key must never be committed, printed or logged.
# Key: https://footystats.org -> your account -> API. On the same site add the
# competitions to your account ("Choose leagues"): the API refuses the data of a
# league that is not chosen ("League is not chosen by the user"), so a competition
# whose league is missing is skipped by the harvester (the others are still
# written). Leagues needed for all 13 configured competitions (the
# `footystats_name` column of config/competitions.toml):
#   Italy Serie C Group A, Italy Serie C Group B, Italy Serie C Group C, Italy Serie B,
#   Italy Serie D Group A, Italy Serie D Group B, Italy Serie D Group C,
#   Italy Serie D Group D, Italy Serie D Group E, Italy Serie D Group F,
#   Italy Serie D Group G, Italy Serie D Group H, Italy Serie D Group I
# FootyStats plans cap the number of chosen leagues: if you cannot add them all,
# narrow the run with `--competitions` (e.g. A B C SB).
FOOTYSTATS_API_KEY=
